e;\n        }\n        .content-block::before {\n            content: '';\n            position: absolute;\n            top: -2px;\n            left: -2px;\n            width: 40px;\n            height: 8px;\n            background-color: #7B61FF;\n        }\n        .content-block.accent::before {\n            background-color: #D97757;\n        }\n        h2 {\n            font-weight: 900;\n            font-size: 28px;\n            color: #212529;\n            margin-bottom: 24px;\n        }\n        p {\n            font-weight: 400;\n            font-size: 24px;\n            color: #495057;\n            line-height: 1.5;\n            margin-bottom: 24px;\n        }\n        .highlight {\n            color: #7B61FF;\n            font-weight: 900;\n        }\n    \u003c/style\u003e\n\u003c/head\u003e\n\u003cbody\u003e\n    \u003cdiv class=\"slide-container\"\u003e\n        \u003cdiv class=\"header-area\"\u003e\n            \u003ch1\u003eOur Team Loses Productivity Switching Between Disconnected Tools\u003c/h1\u003e\n        \u003c/div\u003e\n        \u003cdiv class=\"content-area\"\u003e\n            \u003cdiv class=\"content-block\"\u003e\n                \u003ch2\u003eThe Current Problem\u003c/h2\u003e\n                \u003cp\u003eThe average knowledge worker uses \u003cspan class=\"highlight\"\u003e11 different applications\u003c/span\u003e daily, losing 4+ hours per day to app-switching and context fragmentation.\u003c/p\u003e\n                \u003cp\u003eTeams currently rely on separate tools for messaging, task management, document creation, and AI assistance — with no unified layer connecting them.\u003c/p\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003cdiv class=\"content-block accent\"\u003e\n                \u003ch2\u003eThe Opportunity\u003c/h2\u003e\n                \u003cp\u003eIntegrate a powerful AI assistant (\u003cspan class=\"highlight\"\u003eClaude\u003c/span\u003e) directly into our project management and communication platform (\u003cspan class=\"highlight\"\u003eClickUp\u003c/span\u003e).\u003c/p\u003e\n                \u003cp\u003eThis briefing evaluates Anthropic's Claude, its \"Workspace\" product suite, and how it connects to ClickUp to automate repetitive work, surface insights, and keep the team aligned.\u003c/p\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n        \u003c/div\u003e\n    \u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/body\u003e\n\u003c/html\u003e\n","note":"","width":1280,"height":720},{"id":"slide_3","path":"/home/ubuntu/claude_clickup_presentation/slide_3.html","changed":true,"content":"\u003c!DOCTYPE html\u003e\n\u003chtml lang=\"en\"\u003e\n\u003chead\u003e\n    \u003cmeta charset=\"UTF-8\"\u003e\n    \u003clink href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;900\u0026display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\"\u003e\n    \u003cstyle\u003e\n        * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }\n        body { font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; background-color: #F8F9FA; color: #495057; }\n        .slide-container { \n            width: 1280px; \n            min-height: 720px; \n            background-color: #F8F9FA;\n            position: relative;\n            overflow: hidden;\n            display: grid;\n            grid-template-columns: repeat(12, 1fr);\n            grid-template-rows: 150px 1fr;\n            padding-top: 60px;\n        }\n        .header-area {\n            grid-column: 2 / 12;\n            border-bottom: 2px solid #212529;\n            margin-bottom: 40px;\n        }\n        h1 {\n            font-weight: 900;\n            font-size: 48px;\n            color: #212529;\n            line-height: 1.2;\n            margin-bottom: 20px;\n        }\n        .content-area {\n            grid-column: 2 / 12;\n            display: grid;\n            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr 1fr;\n            gap: 32px;\n        }\n        .content-block {\n            border: 2px solid #212529;\n            padding-top: 32px;\n            padding-left: 24px;\n            padding-right: 24px;\n            background-color: #fff;\n            position: relative;\n        }\n        .content-block::before {\n            content: '';\n            position: absolute;\n            top: -2px;\n            left: -2px;\n            width: 40px;\n            height: 8px;\n            background-color: #7B61FF;\n        }\n        .content-block:nth-child(2)::before {\n            background-color: #D97757;\n        }\n        .content-block:nth-child(3)::before {\n            background-color: #212529;\n        }\n        h2 {\n            font-weight: 900;\n            font-size: 24px;\n            color: #212529;\n            margin-bottom: 24px;\n            line-height: 1.3;\n        }\n        p {\n            font-weight: 400;\n            font-size: 20px;\n            color: #495057;\n            line-height: 1.5;\n            margin-bottom: 24px;\n        }\n        .highlight {\n            color: #7B61FF;\n            font-weight: 900;\n        }\n    \u003c/style\u003e\n\u003c/head\u003e\n\u003cbody\u003e\n    \u003cdiv class=\"slide-container\"\u003e\n        \u003cdiv class=\"header-area\"\u003e\n            \u003ch1\u003eAnthropic Is One of the World's Most Credible AI Companies\u003c/h1\u003e\n        \u003c/div\u003e\n        \u003cdiv class=\"content-area\"\u003e\n            \u003cdiv class=\"content-block\"\u003e\n                \u003ch2\u003eFounded by AI Pioneers\u003c/h2\u003e\n                \u003cp\u003eFounded in 2021 by Dario and Daniela Amodei, former leaders at OpenAI, with a core mission of building safe, reliable, and steerable AI.\u003c/p\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003cdiv class=\"content-block\"\u003e\n                \u003ch2\u003eMassive Valuation \u0026 Backing\u003c/h2\u003e\n                \u003cp\u003eValued at \u003cspan class=\"highlight\"\u003e$380 billion\u003c/span\u003e as of February 2026 after a $30 billion Series G funding round — the second-largest private financing round in history.\u003c/p\u003e\n                \u003cp\u003eBacked by Google and Amazon, both of whom have deep cloud infrastructure partnerships with Anthropic.\u003c/p\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003cdiv class=\"content-block\"\u003e\n                \u003ch2\u003eFocus on AI Safety\u003c/h2\u003e\n                \u003cp\u003eAnthropic's focus on AI safety (via Constitutional AI) makes Claude especially well-suited for professional and enterprise environments where accuracy and consistency matter.\u003c/p\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n        \u003c/div\u003e\n    \u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/body\u003e\n\u003c/html\u003e\n","note":"","width":1280,"height":720},{"id":"slide_4","path":"/home/ubuntu/claude_clickup_presentation/slide_4.html","changed":true,"content":"\u003c!DOCTYPE html\u003e\n\u003chtml lang=\"en\"\u003e\n\u003chead\u003e\n    \u003cmeta charset=\"UTF-8\"\u003e\n    \u003clink href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;900\u0026display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\"\u003e\n    \u003cstyle\u003e\n        * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }\n        body { font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; background-color: #F8F9FA; color: #495057; }\n        .slide-container { \n            width: 1280px; \n            min-height: 720px; \n            background-color: #F8F9FA;\n            position: relative;\n            overflow: hidden;\n            display: grid;\n            grid-template-columns: repeat(12, 1fr);\n            grid-template-rows: 150px 1fr;\n            padding-top: 60px;\n        }\n        .header-area {\n            grid-column: 2 / 12;\n            border-bottom: 2px solid #212529;\n            margin-bottom: 40px;\n        }\n        h1 {\n            font-weight: 900;\n            font-size: 48px;\n            color: #212529;\n            line-height: 1.2;\n            margin-bottom: 20px;\n        }\n        .content-area {\n            grid-column: 2 / 12;\n            display: grid;\n    