    \u003cdiv class=\"slide-container\"\u003e\n        \u003cdiv class=\"header-area\"\u003e\n            \u003ch1\u003eClaude Is a Capable AI Knowledge Worker, Not Just a Chatbot\u003c/h1\u003e\n        \u003c/div\u003e\n        \u003cdiv class=\"content-area\"\u003e\n            \u003cdiv class=\"content-block\"\u003e\n                \u003ch2\u003eMassive Context \u0026 Capabilities\u003c/h2\u003e\n                \u003cp\u003eClaude can write, edit, summarize, analyze data, generate code, conduct research, and draft communications.\u003c/p\u003e\n                \u003cp\u003eIt features a \u003cspan class=\"highlight\"\u003e200,000-token context window\u003c/span\u003e (equivalent to ~150,000 words or hundreds of pages), allowing it to process entire documents at once.\u003c/p\u003e\n                \u003ch2\u003eEnterprise Trust\u003c/h2\u003e\n                \u003cp\u003eTrusted by enterprises across legal, finance, healthcare, marketing, and operations for high-stakes knowledge work.\u003c/p\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003cdiv class=\"content-block accent\"\u003e\n                \u003ch2\u003eThree Model Tiers\u003c/h2\u003e\n                \u003cul\u003e\n                    \u003cli\u003e\u003cspan class=\"highlight-alt\"\u003eOpus 4.6:\u003c/span\u003e Complex reasoning and highly difficult tasks.\u003c/li\u003e\n                    \u003cli\u003e\u003cspan class=\"highlight-alt\"\u003eSonnet 4.5:\u003c/span\u003e Balanced daily use, speed, and intelligence.\u003c/li\u003e\n                    \u003cli\u003e\u003cspan class=\"highlight-alt\"\u003eHaiku 4.5:\u003c/span\u003e Fast, lightweight tasks and high-volume processing.\u003c/li\u003e\n                \u003c/ul\u003e\n                \u003ch2\u003eAvailability\u003c/h2\u003e\n                \u003cp\u003eAvailable via web (claude.ai), desktop app, mobile app (iOS/Android), and API for custom integrations.\u003c/p\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n        \u003c/div\u003e\n