roduct-card\"\u003e\n                \u003cdiv class=\"number\"\u003e03\u003c/div\u003e\n                \u003ch2\u003eClaude Cowork\u003c/h2\u003e\n                \u003cp\u003eAn \u003cspan class=\"highlight\"\u003eagentic AI desktop app\u003c/span\u003e (Jan 2026) that autonomously handles multi-step tasks on your local computer — organizing files, extracting data from PDFs, preparing reports — without requiring technical skills.\u003c/p\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n        \u003c/div\u003e\n    \u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/body\u003e\n\u003c/html\u003e\n","note":"","width":1280,"height":720},{"id":"slide_6","path":"/home/ubuntu/claude_clickup_presentation/slide_6.html","changed":true,"content":"\u003c!DOCTYPE html\u003e\n\u003chtml lang=\"en\"\u003e\n\u003chead\u003e\n    \u003cmeta charset=\"UTF-8\"\u003e\n    \u003clink href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;900\u0026display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\"\u003e\n    \u003cstyle\u003e\n        * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }\n        body { font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; background-color: #F8F9FA; color: #495057; }\n        .slide-container { \n            width: 1280px; \n            min-height: 720px; \n            background-color: #F8F9FA;\n            position: relative;\n            overflow: hidden;\n            display: grid;\n            grid-template-columns: repeat(12, 1fr);\n            grid-template-rows: 150px 1fr;\n            padding-top: 60px;\n        }\n        .header-area {\n            grid-column: 2 / 12;\n            border-bottom: 2px solid #212529;\n            margin-bottom: 40px;\n        }\n        h1 {\n            font-weight: 900;\n            font-size: 48px;\n            color: #212529;\n            line-height: 1.2;\n            margin-bottom: 20px;\n        }\n        .content-area {\n            grid-column: 2 / 12;\n            display: grid;\n            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;\n            grid-template-rows: 1fr 1fr;