003cdiv class=\"content-block\"\u003e\n                \u003ch2\u003eClickUp 4.0 Chat\u003c/h2\u003e\n                \u003cp\u003eUpgraded to near feature-parity with Slack: includes channels, DMs, threads, scheduled messages, assigned comments, pinned cards, and file sharing.\u003c/p\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003cdiv class=\"content-block\"\u003e\n                \u003ch2\u003eClickUp Brain (Native AI)\u003c/h2\u003e\n                \u003cp\u003eThe native AI layer answers questions about your workspace, auto-generates status reports, and writes content. Users can now select \u003cspan class=\"highlight\"\u003eClaude Opus\u003c/span\u003e as the AI model.\u003c/p\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003cdiv class=\"content-block\"\u003e\n                \u003ch2\u003eSuper Agents\u003c/h2\u003e\n                \u003cp\u003eIntroduced in Dec 2025, these are AI \"coworkers\" that exist as real users in the workspace. They can be assigned tasks, @mentioned, and scheduled to perform autonomous work.\u003c/p\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n        \u003c/div\u003e\n    \u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/body\u003e\n\u003c/html\u003e\n","note":"","width":1280,"height":720},{"id":"slide_7","path":"/home/ubuntu/claude_clickup_presentation/slide_7.html","changed":true,"content":"\u003c!DOCTYPE html\u003e\n\u003chtml lang=\"en\"\u003e\n\u003chead\u003e\n    \u003cmeta charset=\"UTF-8\"\u003e\n    \u003clink href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;900\u0026display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\"\u003e\n    \u003cstyle\u003e\n        *{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box}\n        body{font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;background:#F8F9FA;color:#495057}\n        .slide-container{\n            width:1280px;\n            min-height:720px;\n            background:#F8F9FA;\n            position:relative;\n            overflow:hidden;\n            display:grid;\n            grid-template-columns:repeat(12,1fr);\n            gri