\n                    \u003ch2\u003ePowered by MCP\u003c/h2\u003e\n                    \u003cp\u003eIntegration is powered by the \u003cspan class=\"highlight\"\u003eModel Context Protocol (MCP)\u003c/span\u003e — an open standard that lets Claude securely connect to external tools.\u003c/p\u003e\n                    \u003cp\u003eClickUp provides an official MCP server across plans, compatible with Claude Desktop.\u003c/p\u003e\n                \u003c/div\u003e\n                \u003cdiv class=\"example-block\"\u003e\n                    \u003cdiv class=\"example-label\"\u003eExample Command\u003c/div\u003e\n                    \u003cp\u003e\"Find overdue tasks in Product Launch and draft a short team summary.\"\u003c/p\u003e\n                \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003cdiv class=\"right-col\"\u003e\n                \u003cdiv class=\"content-block\"\u003e\n                    \u003ch2\u003eWhat Claude Can Do in ClickUp via MCP\u003c/h2\u003e\n                    \u003cul\u003e\n                        \u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eTask Management:\u003c/strong\u003e Create and assign tasks.\u003c/li\u003e\n                        \u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eReporting:\u003c/strong\u003e Generate status reports.\u003c/li\u003e\n                        \u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSearch:\u003c/strong\u003e Find tasks and projects.\u003c/li\u003e\n                        \u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCollaboration:\u003c/strong\u003e Summarize threads and extract actions.\u003c/li\u003e\n                        \u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eTime Tracking:\u003c/strong\u003e Log time from chat.\u003c/li\u003e\n                    \u003c/ul\u003e\n                \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n        \u003c/div\u003e\n    \u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/body\u003e\n\u003c/html\u003e\n","note":"","width":1280,"height":720},{"id":"slide_8","path":"/home/ubuntu/claude_clickup_presentation/slide_8.html","changed"